"In the winter before Hannah's funeral, Skiff chased an earth-shaping villain in Chicago."
"The villain had spent years tunneling a lair under Lake Michigan."
"The chase began at North Avenue Beach."
"Skiff flooded downtown buildings and collapsed a sewer."
"The villain was drowned and ended up in intensive care."
"Skiff had a spotless casualty record and looked strained on TV afterward."
